  "description": "Attribute-driven dependency injection on top of Autofac. Mark a class with [Component] and it is scanned, registered and injected automatically — no per-service RegisterType line, no conditional wiring to maintain by hand. Supports property/field/method/constructor injection, [Primary] and [Qualifier] for selecting among multiple implementations, conditional registration, initialization ordering, and lifecycle/post-processor hooks. Extension packages add configuration binding, event bus, Quartz jobs, interception, aggregate services and transactions — Core itself carries none of them.",
